Rules

Write exactly {{ count }} alternatives. Do not repeat the original query.

Each alternative must mean the same thing as the original, phrased the way a
different person might search for it. Vary the wording, not the intent.

Use the vocabulary of an issue tracker: bug, defect, ticket, task, blocker,
regression, assigned, reported, resolved.

Do not answer the question. Do not add filters, dates, or details the original
